meta {
  name: Get stats
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/users/me/stats
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Job market statistics for the home page, limited to the logged-in user's
  fields (the companies in the profile's industries; all jobs when the profile
  has no industries).

  - periodDays: STATS_PERIOD_DAYS from the backend .env.
  - newJobs: active jobs posted (or first seen) within periodDays.
  - activeJobs / hiringCompanies: all active jobs and their companies.
  - newCompanies: companies added within periodDays.
  - topSkills: most requested skills with their share (%) of activeJobs.
  - topCompanies: companies with the most open jobs.
  - topSkills / topCompanies length: STATS_TOP_LIMIT from the backend .env.
  - 401: run Login
}
